# Excluded when packaging the plugin for distribution or deploying to a server.
#
# The bridge is a developer tool: it runs on the operator's machine, not on the
# web host. Its node_modules are devDependencies only (TypeScript and type
# definitions) and add ~26 MB of files that would never be executed on the site.

bridge/node_modules
bridge/src
bridge/tsconfig.json
.distignore
.git
.gitignore
